# Cross entropy of logits [N,K] against a target of the same shape. The rows
# of the logits are centered by their maximum and folded into the logarithm
# of the sum of their exponentials; the loss adds the products with the
# target and divides by -N, the gradient divides the exponentials minus the
# target by N.
